### SCENARIO: Employee cancels an already approved request
### Prerequisites: run 01-seed-balances.http first, mock HCM running on :3001

### Step 1: Create a request
POST http://localhost:3000/requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employeeId": "emp-2",
  "locationId": "loc-nyc",
  "policyType": "VACATION",
  "startDate": "2026-08-01",
  "endDate": "2026-08-03",
  "days": 2,
  "idempotencyKey": "cancel-approved-001"
}

### Step 2: Approve it (replace REQUEST_ID)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/requests/{{REQUEST_ID}}/approve
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reviewerNote": "Approved"
}

### Step 3: Check balance — used should have increased
GET http://localhost:3000/balances/emp-2/loc-nyc

### Step 4: Cancel the approved request (replace REQUEST_ID)
# Expected: 200 CANCELLED, used days restored
PATCH http://localhost:3000/requests/{{REQUEST_ID}}/cancel

### Step 5: Verify balance — used should be back to original
GET http://localhost:3000/balances/emp-2/loc-nyc
